  "content": "<blockquote>\n<p>子路宿於石門。晨門曰：「奚自？」子路曰：「自孔氏。」曰：「是<a href=\"https://dict.revised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=113209&amp;la=0&amp;powerMode=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>知其不可而微之</strong></a>者與？」</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://noachen522.github.io/noasblog/u-r-boring_1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>（<a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/tw/podcast/%E5%B0%8F%E7%86%B1now/id1721855075\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">小熱NOW</a>冷笑話聽眾上數學課。）</p>\n<hr>\n<p>（甄嬛傳觀眾考國文。）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://noachen522.github.io/noasblog/u-r-boring_2-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://noachen522.github.io/noasblog/u-r-boring_2-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://noachen522.github.io/noasblog/u-r-boring_2-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"><br>\n劇中畫面攻擊我。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://noachen522.github.io/noasblog/u-r-boring_3-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://noachen522.github.io/noasblog/u-r-boring_3-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"><br>\n不准評論<a href=\"https://noa.bearblog.dev/consort-hua-is-cuuute/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">我家華妃</a> (`へ´≠)</p>",
